# An agent stopped at the vendor's folder-trust gate, as claude 2.1.259 draws
# it at 54 columns. There are no hooks under it on purpose: the vendor puts
# this screen in front of a session rather than inside one, so the screen is
# the whole of what a reader has to go on. The choices carry no numbers at this
# version and the cursor opens on the exit, which is the shape that decides
# what the question reads back as.
