print  open source project, or work from your team). If
print  not, take a moment to review what's in this folder
print  first.
print
print  Claude Code'll be able to read, edit, and execute
print  files here.
print
print  Security guide
print
print  ❯ No, exit
print    Yes, I trust this folder
print
print  Enter to confirm · Esc to cancel
